[Mission.Objectives]
Destroy the enemy defense and capture the village.
[Mission.Description]
The enemy has turned the village ahead into a key strategic location which HQ has demanded be captured. The terrain in this area features a large hill overlooking the town, hindering long range observation. Our recon elements report that the enemy is well fortified and supported by self-propelled artillery and AT guns. 
 
Your orders:
- Destroy the enemy defenses.
- Capture the village.
[Mission.Success]
Well done Commander!
[Mission.Failed]
Mission failed! Your troops have been defeated.
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Capture the enemy position.
[Submission_1.Description]
The broken terrain will force engagements under 500 meters, but the enemy village ahead must be taken.
 
Your orders:
- Using any and all means, drive the enemy from the field and occupy his positions!
[Submission_1.Success]
Well done Commander! Your troops are victorious.
[Submission_1.Failed]
Mission failed! You have failed.